  ('m','Who proposed that the Earth spins on its axis?','Aryabhata','Charaka','Kalidasa','He explained day and night.'),
  ('t','The Iron Pillar of Delhi rusts quickly.',False,'It has hardly rusted in about 1,600 years.'),
